  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice cucumber into half-moons.\n• Thinly slice celery.\n• In a medium bowl, combine the vinegar and a good pinch of sugar and salt.\n• Add cucumber to pickling liquid. Add enough water to just cover cucumber.\n• Set aside.\n• TIP: Slicing the cucumber very thinly helps it pickle faster!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68dc7423396adcc61a3e89c0/step-741cc200.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until just browned, 2-3 minutes each side. Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68dc7423396adcc61a3e89c0/step-cbd2f610.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a second medium bowl, combine celery, slaw mix, plant-based mayonnaise, a splash of pickling liquid and a drizzle of olive oil. Toss to coat. Season to taste with salt and pepper.\n• Microwave mini flourtortillas on a microwave-safe plate in 10 second bursts, until warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68dc7423396adcc61a3e89c0/step-e0aa2020.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain pickled cucumber. Roughly chop plant-based chicken.\n• Build your tacos by filling each tortilla with a helping of creamy celery slaw, pickled cucumber and crumbed chick’n.\n• Drizzle over sweet chilli sauce. Sprinkle over crispy shallots to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68dc7423396adcc61a3e89c0/step-ef6b6930.jpg"
    }
  ]
